# Volusion deploy (known-good as of 2026-06-07)

## Core targets (NOT mrp.css / mrp.js)

Always upload + verify these three on every deploy:

| Local | Browser URL | SFTP canonical path (upload first) |
|---|---|---|
| `template_266.html` | `/v/template_266.html` | `/v/template_266.html` |
| `vspfiles/css/custom-safe.css` | `/v/vspfiles/css/custom-safe.css` | `/v/vspfiles/css/custom-safe.css` |
| `vspfiles/templates/266/css/mccabe-overrides.css` | `/v/vspfiles/templates/266/css/mccabe-overrides.css` | `/v/vspfiles/templates/266/css/mccabe-overrides.css` |

**Regression:** Uploading only to `/vspfiles/…` (no `/v/` prefix) makes CI look green while live HTTP stays stale.

## Pipeline files

- Workflow: `.github/workflows/deploy.yml` — triggers on `main` push to `vspfiles/**`, `template_266.html`, deploy scripts
- Shell: `.github/scripts/deploy-volusion.sh` — template FIRST, then Paramiko + lftp
- Assets: `scripts/deploy_volusion_assets.py` — requires `/v/vspfiles/` canonical match
- Gate: `scripts/verify_volusion_core_deploy.py` — SFTP MD5 + HTTP markers (curl first; urllib gets 403 on GHA)

## Always-deploy (never skip on DEPLOY_CHANGED_ONLY)

`CRITICAL_ALWAYS` in deploy-volusion.sh + `_ALWAYS_DEPLOY` in deploy_volusion_assets.py:

- `template_266.html`
- `vspfiles/css/custom-safe.css`
- `vspfiles/templates/266/css/mccabe-overrides.css`

`workflow_dispatch` sets `DEPLOY_CHANGED_ONLY=0` for full deploy.

## Deploy markers (sync all three when bumping)

- Template: `<meta name="mc-deploy-verify" content="TOKEN">` + `MC_DEPLOY_VERIFY_TOKEN` comment
- custom-safe.css line 1: `C_CSS_DEPLOY_VERIFY_TOKEN`
- mccabe-overrides.css header: `MC_OVERRIDES_VERIFY_TOKEN`

Current token: `20260607deploy`. Search live View Source / fetch CSS URLs for this string.

## Green CI log lines

- `FORCE_TEMPLATE verified on: /v/template_266.html`
- `SFTP custom-safe OK on: /v/vspfiles/css/custom-safe.css`
- `SFTP mccabe-overrides OK on: /v/vspfiles/templates/266/css/mccabe-overrides.css`
- `CORE_DEPLOY_VERIFIED`

## If deploy “succeeds” but site looks stale

1. Check SFTP MD5 on `/v/vspfiles/` paths (authoritative), not HTTP alone
2. Rebake baked HTML: Volusion **Design → File Editor → template_266.html → Save**
3. Restore from commits `f38966d` (paths + markers) and `456872f` (curl HTTP verify)

## Do not change until deploy confirmed

Avoid editing mobile layout, PDP layout, or CSS behavior while debugging deploy — only marker comments and pipeline files.
